Arrows	Move selection
Tab	Switch panel
Enter	Open or execute
Home	First item
End	Last item
F1	Left drive
F2	Right drive
F3	Other panel info
F4	Edit file in editor
F5	Copy item to another panel
F6	Move item to another panel
F7	Make directory
F8	Delete file or directory
F9	Open help
F10	Open console
Shift+F1	Sort left panel
Shift+F2	Sort right panel
Shift+F3	Open help
Shift+F4	New document in editor
Shift+F5	Copy item to another panel
Shift+F6	Rename item
Shift+F7	Make directory
Ctrl+Enter	Insert path to command line
Ctrl+F10	Exit Commander
Esc	Clear command
Hold Shift	File toolbar
